| `array_map` | Concise, functional style, applies `array_sum` to each row |
| `array_sum` | Built-in PHP function that sums all values in a 1D array |

Both approaches produce identical results. The `array_map` version is more concise, while the `foreach` version is more explicit and easier to extend with additional logic.

